# Hidden under niri: comes with the Cinnamon fallback session
[Desktop Entry]
NotShowIn=niri;
Categories=System;Settings;Printing;HardwareSettings;X-Red-Hat-Base;
Exec=xdg-open http://localhost:631/
Icon=cups
StartupNotify=false
Terminal=false
Type=Application
Name=Manage Printing
Comment=CUPS Web Interface
